            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Misogyny and its amplification through the \"manosphere\" may be a key driver of ideologically motivated extremism in young men and boys in Australia, the antisemitism royal commission has heard."
